{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-1","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Like things happen to good and bad. 4 There is a necessity of death unto men. 7 Comfort is all their portion in this life. 11 God's providence rules over all. 13 Wisdom is better than strength.</p>\n<p>considered in my heart. Heb. gave, or set to my heart. 1:17; 7:25; 8:16; 12:9,10 that the. 8:14; De 33:3; 1Sa 2:9; 2Sa 15:25,26; Job 5:8; Ps 10:14; 31:5 Ps 37:5,6; Pr 16:3; Isa 26:12; 49:1-4; Jer 1:18,19; Joh 10:27-30 1Co 3:5-15; 2Ti 1:12; 1Pe 1:5 no man. 7:15; Ps 73:3,11-13; Mal 3:15-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-2","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>alike. 2:14-16; Job 21:7-34; Ps 73:3; Mal 3:15 as is. 2:26; 7:18; 8:12-14 feareth. Ge 24:3,8,9; Jos 2:17-20; 1Sa 14:26; Eze 17:18,19; Zec 5:3,4 Mal 3:5,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-3","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>also. 8:11; Ge 6:5; 8:21; Job 15:16; Ps 51:5; Jer 17:9; Mt 15:19,20 Mr 7:21-23; Ro 1:29-31; Tit 3:3 and madness. 1:17; 7:25; Lu 6:11; 15:17; Ac 26:11,24; 2Pe 2:16 after. 12:7; Pr 14:32; Ac 12:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-4","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Job 14:7-12; 27:8; Isa 38:18; La 3:21,22; Lu 16:26-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-5","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the living. 7:2; Job 30:23; Heb 9:27 the dead. Job 14:21; Ps 6:5; 88:10,11; Isa 63:16 for the. 2:16; 8:10; Job 7:8-10; Ps 109:15; Isa 26:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-6","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>their love. Ex 1:8; Job 3:17,18; Ps 146:3,4; Pr 10:28; Mt 2:20 have they. 2:18-23; 6:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-7","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Go. Ge 12:19; Mr 7:29; Joh 4:50 eat. 2:24-26; 3:12,13; 5:18; 8:15; 10:19; De 12:7,12; 16:14,15; 1Ki 8:66 1Ch 16:1-3; 29:21-23; 2Ch 30:23-27; Ne 8:10-12 for. Ge 4:4,5; Ex 24:8-11; Lu 11:41; Ac 10:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-8","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>thy garments. 2Sa 19:24; Es 8:15; Re 3:4,5; 7:9,13,14; 16:15; 19:8,14 let thy head. Ru 3:3; 2Sa 14:2; Da 10:3; Am 6:6; Mt 6:17; Lu 7:46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-9","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Live joyfully. Heb. See, or Enjoy life. with the wife. Pr 5:18,19; 18:22; 19:14; Mal 2:15 all the days of the life. 6:12; Ps 39:5; 144:4 for. 2:10,24; 3:13,22; 5:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-10","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>thy hand. Nu 13:30; 1Ch 22:19; 28:20; 29:2,3; 2Ch 31:20,21; Ezr 6:14,15 Ne 2:12-20; 3:1-16; 4:2,6,9-13,17-23; 13:8-31; Ps 71:15-18 Jer 29:13; Mt 6:33; Joh 4:34; Ro 12:11; 15:18-20; 1Co 9:24,26 1Co 15:10; 16:10; Eph 5:16; Col 3:23; 2Pe 1:12-15 for. 5,6; 11:3; Job 14:7-12; Ps 6:5; 88:10-12; Isa 38:18,19; Joh 9:4 Ac 20:25-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-11","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>returned. 2:12; 4:1,4; Mal 3:18 that the race. 1Sa 17:50; 2Sa 2:18-23; 17:14,23; Ps 33:16,17; 73:6,7; 147:10,11 Jer 9:23; 46:6; Am 2:14-16 but. 2:14,15; 3:14,17; 7:13; 1Sa 2:3-10; Job 5:11-14; 34:29; Pr 21:30,31 La 3:37,38; Da 4:35; Eph 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-12","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>man. 8:5-7,11; Lu 19:42-44; 2Co 6:2; 1Pe 2:12 as the fishes. Pr 7:22,23; Hab 1:14-17; 2Ti 2:26 the sons. Job 18:8-10; Ps 11:6; 73:18-20; Pr 6:15; 29:6; Isa 30:13 Lu 12:20,39; 17:26-31; 21:34-36; 1Th 5:3; 2Pe 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-13","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>11; 6:1; 7:15; 8:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-14","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>There was. 2Sa 20:15-22; 2Ki 6:24-33; 7:1-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-15","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>yet. Ge 40:23; Es 6:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-16","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Wisdom. 18; 7:19; Pr 21:22; 24:5 the poor. Pr 10:15; Mr 6:2,3; Joh 7:47-49; 9:24-34; 1Co 1:26-29; Jas 2:2-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-17","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Ge 41:33-40; 1Sa 7:3-6; Pr 28:23; Isa 42:2,4; Jas 1:20; 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-9-18","title":"Ecclesiastes 9:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>better. 16 sinner. Jos 7:1,5,11,12; 22:20; 1Sa 14:28,29,36-46; 2Sa 20:1,2 2Th 2:8-12; 2Ti 2:16-18; 3:8; 4:3,4; Tit 1:10,11; Heb 12:15,16</p>"}]}